GBA link-port cartridge flasher
===============================

This project includes or derives from the following work:

FlashGBX
  https://github.com/Lesserkuma/FlashGBX
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  The flash chip command sequences in flash.py (M36L0R8060B / Intel command
  set, from config/fc_AGB_M36L0R806.txt) are derived from FlashGBX's
  cartridge profile data.

gbasend-rs
  https://github.com/nullstalgia/gbasend-rs
  License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
  The prebuilt gbasend-pico firmware images in firmware/ are unmodified
  copies from that repository.

Nintendo logo
  The Game Boy Advance cartridge header embedded in the payload includes the
  Nintendo logo. It is a trademark of Nintendo and is present only because the
  console's BIOS requires it to boot the payload.
